# Minar Academy — Parent API so'rovlari (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client).
# O'zgaruvchilar environment faylida (http-client.env.json yoki settings.json "rest-client.environmentVariables"),
# repoga real credential yozmang:
#   { "staging": { "baseUrl": "https://crm.minaracademy.uz/api", "username": "+99890…", "password": "…",
#                  "childId": "101", "groupId": "201", "notificationId": "501" } }

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

### [01] Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/parent/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "{{username}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@access = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### [02] Refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/parent/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{refresh}}"}

### [03] Profil
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [04] Profilni yangilash (204)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parent/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"display_name": "Nodira Mominova"}

### [05] Farzandlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [06] To'lov xulosasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/payment-summary?month=10&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [07] To'lov — checkout URL (provayder sozlanmagan bo'lsa 503)
POST {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 250000, "group_id": {{groupId}}, "provider": "payme"}

### [08] Davomat
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/attendance?month=10&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [09] Jadval
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [10] Bildirishnomalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [11] O'qildi (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/parent/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [12] Baholar
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [13] Uy vazifalari
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/homework
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [14] Izohlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [15] Sertifikatlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/certificates
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### [16] O'qituvchi
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/teacher
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Xato formati namunasi (422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{childId}}/payment-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
